te\ndeep in your component tree without needing to pass a selector to the hook."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"type-parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"tselected-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TSelected"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"props","children":[{"type":"text","value":"props"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":6,"id":"children","children":[{"type":"text","value":"children"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Element"},{"type":"text","value":" | (("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Element"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":6,"id":"selector","children":[{"type":"text","value":"selector"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"state"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Element"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<queuer.Subscribe selector={(state) => ({ size: state.size, isRunning: state.isRunning })}>\n  {(state) => (\n    <div>Queue: {state().size} items, {state().isRunning ? 'Processing' : 'Idle'}</div>\n  )}\n</queuer.Subscribe>","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"tselected","text":"TSelected","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"overrides","text":"Overrides","level":4},{"id":"setoptions","text":"setOptions","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"options-2","text":"options","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"overrides-2","text":"Overrides","level":4},{"id":"state","text":"state","level":3},{"id":"store","text":"store","level":3},{"id":"deprecated","text":"Deprecated","level":4},{"id":"subscribe","text":"Subscribe","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters-2","text":"Type Parameters","level":4},{"id":"tselected-2","text":"TSelected","level":5},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"props","text":"props","level":5},{"id":"children","text":"children","level":6},{"id":"selector","text":"selector","level":6},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:22](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L22)\n\n## Extends\n\n- `Omit`\\<`Queuer`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"store\"`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n## Properties\n\n### options\n\n```ts\noptions: QueuerOptions<TValue> & SolidQueuerOptions<TValue, TSelected>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:26](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L26)\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nOmit.options\n```\n\n***\n\n### setOptions\n\n```ts\nsetOptions: (options) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:27](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L27)\n\nUpdates the queuer options. New options are merged with existing options.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n`Partial`\\<[`SolidQueuerOptions`](SolidQueuerOptions.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nOmit.setOptions\n```\n\n***\n\n### state\n\n```ts\nreadonly state: Accessor<Readonly<TSelected>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:51](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L51)\n\nReactive state that will be updated when the queuer state changes\n\nUse this instead of `queuer.store.state`\n\n***\n\n### ~~store~~\n\n```ts\nreadonly store: Store<Readonly<QueuerState<TValue>>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:57](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L57)\n\n#### Deprecated\n\nUse `queuer.state` instead of `queuer.store.state` if you want to read reactive state.\nThe state on the store object is not reactive, as it has not been wrapped in a `useSelector` hook internally.\nAlthough, you can make the state reactive by using the `useSelector` in your own usage.\n\n***\n\n### Subscribe\n\n```ts\nSubscribe: <TSelected>(props) => Element;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:42](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L42)\n\nA Solid component that allows you to subscribe to the queuer state.\n\nThis is useful for tracking specific parts of the queuer state\ndeep in your component tree without needing to pass a selector to the hook.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TSelected\n\n`TSelected`\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### props\n\n###### children\n\n`Element` \\| ((`state`) => `Element`)\n\n###### selector\n\n(`state`) => `TSelected`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Element`\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\n<queuer.Subscribe selector={(state) => ({ size: state.size, isRunning: state.isRunning })}>\n  {(state) => (\n    <div>Queue: {state().size} items, {state().isRunning ? 'Processing' : 'Idle'}</div>\n  )}\n</queuer.Subscribe>\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SolidQueuer\ntitle: SolidQueuer\n---\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:22](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L22)\n\n## Extends\n\n- `Omit`\\<`Queuer`\\<`TValue`\\>, `\"store\"`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n## Properties\n\n### options\n\n```ts\noptions: QueuerOptions<TValue> & SolidQueuerOptions<TValue, TSelected>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:26](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L26)\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nOmit.options\n```\n\n***\n\n### setOptions\n\n```ts\nsetOptions: (options) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:27](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L27)\n\nUpdates the queuer options. New options are merged with existing options.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### options\n\n`Partial`\\<[`SolidQueuerOptions`](SolidQueuerOptions.md)\\<`TValue`, `TSelected`\\>\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nOmit.setOptions\n```\n\n***\n\n### state\n\n```ts\nreadonly state: Accessor<Readonly<TSelected>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:51](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L51)\n\nReactive state that will be updated when the queuer state changes\n\nUse this instead of `queuer.store.state`\n\n***\n\n### ~~store~~\n\n```ts\nreadonly store: Store<Readonly<QueuerState<TValue>>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:57](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L57)\n\n#### Deprecated\n\nUse `queuer.state` instead of `queuer.store.state` if you want to read reactive state.\nThe state on the store object is not reactive, as it has not been wrapped in a `useSelector` hook internally.\nAlthough, you can make the state reactive by using the `useSelector` in your own usage.\n\n***\n\n### Subscribe\n\n```ts\nSubscribe: <TSelected>(props) => Element;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/createQueuer.ts:42](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/solid-pacer/src/queuer/createQueuer.ts#L42)\n\nA Solid component that allows you to subscribe to the queuer state.\n\nThis is useful for tracking specific parts of the queuer state\ndeep in your component tree without needing to pass a selector to the hook.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TSelected\n\n`TSelected`\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### props\n\n###### children\n\n`Element` \\| ((`state`) => `Element`)\n\n###### selector\n\n(`state`) => `TSelected`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Element`\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\n<queuer.Subscribe selector={(state) => ({ size: state.size, isRunning: state.isRunning })}>\n  {(state) => (\n    <div>Queue: {state().size} items, {state().isRunning ? 'Processing' : 'Idle'}</div>\n  )}\n</queuer.Subscribe>\n```\n"}
